            "review_title": "Review at Nhà Hàng Chay Vegan Bà Xã - Pasteur",
            "review_text": "Hồ Y\n1 contribution\n0\nJul 2025 • Friends\nAbsolutely love this place!\n\nQuán chay Bà Xã is a hidden gem for anyone who enjoys healthy, delicious, and soulful vegetarian food. Every dish is thoughtfully prepared, full of flavor, and beautifully presented. The ingredients are fresh, the seasoning is just right, and you can feel the care in every bite.\n\nThe atmosphere is cozy and welcoming — perfect for a quiet meal or a casual gathering with friends. The staff are friendly, attentive, and always ready to recommend something special from the menu.\n\nHighly recommend trying their Fried rice, Fried glass noodles, sour soup and Lẩu chao - it’s a must! Whether you’re a long-time vegetarian or just curious to try something new, Bà Xã is definitely worth a visit.\n\nI’ll be coming back again (and again)!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 21, 2025",
